submittedParameters.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Production game vegetation lifecycle art atlas. Exactly NINE complete isolated plant death-state props, 3 by3 evenly spaced grid on TRUE transparent alpha. All9 same orthographic2:1 isometric southeast game camera, soft upper-left daylight, finely hand-painted rounded Taoist chibi style matching attached images: natural warm wood, muted jade/teal, warm ivory and tiny gold accents. World-camera/material reference is third image; first2 images are rendering/style not UI frames.
NO text, grid lines, letters, labels, characters, UI panels, checkerboard or watermark. Each complete object entirely within middle75% of its cell, wide gutters. Crisp transparent edges. Thin small root/earth contact only, no floating island or large background.
Read left-to-right/top-to-bottom:
1 dying desert saguaro cactus: shrivelled ochre-green ribbed trunk with two short drooping arms, still upright, one dry base root;
2 dead cactus remains: low broken dry ribbed cactus stub and one fallen hollow arm, ochre tan rather than fresh green;
3 dying palm tree: slim tall slightly bent palm trunk, crown of five dry curled brown fronds hanging down, no healthy green;
4 dead palm stump: short fibrous palm trunk stub, broken pale core, tiny exposed roots;
5 dying toyland lollipop tree: rounded caramel wood branching trunk, two faded mint/cream candy discs cracked and drooping on branches, no fresh leaves;
6 dead toyland candy-tree stump: low spiral-pattern caramel trunk stump and a small fallen cracked candy disc beside it, desaturated mint/ivory;
7 dying cotton-candy tree: thin caramel branching trunk with small shrunken dusty-pink cotton tufts clinging only to branch tips;
8 dead cotton-candy stump: short bare caramel twig stump with tiny exposed roots and a few pale cotton scraps on ground;
9 dying baobab/broadleaf: thick gnarled warm-grey tree trunk with wide bare branching crown, a few curled dry ochre leaves, no green canopy.
Natural believable plant silhouettes with fine brush edges and gentle shadow, not sticker icons, not photoreal or glossy3D.

